@prefix rdashow: <https://shapething.com/showcases/rda-fr#> .

# Overlay for the RDA-FR showcase (Showcases/Application profiles/RDA): adds one
# st:DrawerPropertyGroup per showcased class, and moves every one of that class's
# optional (no sh:minCount >= 1) properties into it - kept as a separate file rather
# than editing rdafr-shacl.ttl (a real, generated 34k-line vocabulary dump) in place.
# Loaded alongside it via argsByTestFile's multi-file merge in rda-fr.stories.tsx.

# Œuvre (C100001): 3 required, 304 optional
rdashow:C100001Drawer a sh:PropertyGroup, st:DrawerPropertyGroup ;
    sh:order 1000 ;
    sh:name "Autres éléments"@fr .

